This guide covers the technician as a person and a role, not the equipment around them: which package puts one on site, what they actually do while your event runs, and how to book one for your date. For the coverage itself, phase by phase, with the named equipment our crew troubleshoots, see our [technical support for events](/blog/technical-support-for-events/) guide. If your event runs on a package with no technician, our [AV system troubleshooting](/blog/av-system-troubleshooting/) guide covers what to check yourself instead, package by package.

