## How to Book a Technician

Booking a technician follows the same process as any other package: choose the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) or [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) if you want one included, or add the technician option to your [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) quote request. [Contact us](/contact/) with your event date, guest count and expected run time, especially if your event might run past the MICE Pack's 6 hour cap, so we can confirm the technician's hours before you book.

Demand for technician covered packages peaks during wedding season, from April through October, so lock in your date as early as you can once it is confirmed. For the full step by step process our crew follows on delivery day, see our [how audio visual rental works](/blog/how-audio-visual-rental-works/) guide.

## Conclusion

Whether a technician is on site with your event depends on the package, not a blanket policy: not offered on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), a paid add on on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), included for the full event on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), and included up to 6 hours on the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/). [Contact us](/contact/) to confirm technician coverage for your date. For our full audio visual rental range, see the [audio visual rental page](/blog/audio-visual-rental/).

## FAQs

### Can I hire just an AV technician, without renting your equipment?

No. We do not sell a technician as a standalone service, only as part of one of our own equipment packages. See [Can You Hire Just a Technician, Without the Equipment?](#can-you-hire-just-a-technician-without-the-equipment) above.

### Which packages include an AV technician?

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include one as standard, the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers one as a paid add on at 240 euros per day, and the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) does not offer one at all. See [Technician by Package](#technician-by-package-whats-included-and-what-costs-extra) above for the full breakdown.

### What does an AV technician actually do during my event?

They run gain staging and signal testing before your event starts, adjust microphone levels live as different speakers take the mic, manage the handoff between speakers so there is no dead air, and fix a dropped connection or a projector that loses sync in the moment. See [What an AV Technician Actually Does On Site](#what-an-av-technician-actually-does-on-site) above.

### How much does it cost to add a technician to the Basic MICE Pack?

240 euros per day, ex VAT, on top of the 295 euro Basic MICE Pack price. The technician is available for the full event day once added.

### Is the Wedding Pack technician on site for the whole event, or a set number of hours?

The whole event, with no hour cap. This is the only package where technician coverage is not limited to a fixed number of hours, which matters for a wedding day that runs from ceremony through dancing.

### What happens if my event runs longer than the MICE Pack's 6 hour technician cap?

Each additional hour is billed at 40 euros. If your event is likely to run past 6 hours, mention your expected run time when you book so we can confirm the technician's availability and cost for the extra hours in advance.

### Do I need a technician for a small party or DJ set?

Usually not. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is a self run PA system with no technician on site, built for a DJ or host who controls their own levels. See our [audio visual rental for music performances](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-music-performances/) guide.

### How far in advance should I book if I need a technician?

As early as you can once your event date is confirmed. Demand for technician covered packages, especially the Wedding Pack, peaks during wedding season from April through October, when technicians book up first.

### What experience does your AV technician have?

Our technicians are our own crew, not a subcontracted team, and Malaga Event Gear has operated in the audiovisual rental sector since 1996. Every technician we send is dispatched with our own equipment, which is what they are trained and calibrated on.

### Do you provide an AV technician for events outside Malaga city, like Marbella or Fuengirola?

Yes. Our technician covered packages serve Malaga city and extend across the Costa del Sol, including Marbella and Fuengirola. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue so we can confirm coverage for your specific location.
